                <pb facs="0863" n="749" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg749"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/2868: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Ramer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-23T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 23, 1922—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>21. Your 31, May 21, 11 p.m.</p>
                <p>Your action is approved and the Department desires to commend the prompt and
                    capable manner in which you handled the situation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
